        "original_id": "0f2c68fe-a822-5ea7-899d-76728cd3b6c5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: \"The Hand That Feeds,\" \"Closer,\" \"Hurt\"\n- People: Mark Romanek, Johnny Cash, Madonna, Michael Jackson, Janet Jackson\n- Organizations: Nine Inch Nails, Red Hot Chili Peppers\n- Products: Billboard Hot 100, pop radio, The Downward Spiral\n\nFacts:\n- \"Closer\" is a song by Nine Inch Nails from the band’s 1994 second studio album \"The Downward Spiral.\"\n- Nine Inch Nails had top 40 radio hits with \"Closer\" in 1994 and \"Hurt\" in 1995.\n- Mark Romanek directed notable music videos including Nine Inch Nails’ \"Closer,\" Johnny Cash’s \"Hurt,\" Red Hot Chili Peppers’ \"Can’t Stop,\" Madonna’s \"Bedtime Story,\" and Michael and Janet Jackson’s \"Scream.\"\n- \"The Hand That Feeds\" became a crossover hit for Nine Inch Nails by crossing over to pop radio.\n- \"The Hand That Feeds\" peaked at number 31 on the Billboard Hot 100.\n- \"The Hand That Feeds\" was Nine Inch Nails’ first top 40 pop radio hit since \"Closer\" and \"Hurt.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
